        <member name="M:HyFive.Admin.Controllers.SeedController.SeedCodeSystem">
            <summary>
            Seeds all necessary static code lists required for the application to run:
            OverforingstatusTyper (TransferStatusTypes), AktivitetTyper (ActivityTypes), Indications, HandsmykkeTyper (HandJewelryTypes), 
            BeskyttelsesutstyrTyper (ProtectiveEquipmentTypes), BeskyttelsesutstyrsettingTyper (ProtectiveEquipmentSettingTypes),
            GloveWithIndicationTypes, GloveWithoutIndicationType, PostGloveHandHygieneType.
            In addition, an FHI Admin is seeded: Felix Mørk.
            To seed municipalities, you must run the script "HyFive.DataAccess\Scripts\Kommuner.sql"
            </summary>
            <returns></returns>
        </member>
        <member name="M:HyFive.Admin.Controllers.SeedController.SeedFacilities">
            <summary>
            Seeds a limited set of facilities, FacilitiesTypes, departments, DepartmentTypes, Roles, and Users.
            If you need more than this, you can run the SQL script "HyFive.DataAccess\Scripts\Facilities, departments, etc.sql".
            NOTE: You must use EITHER this API method OR the script.
            </summary>
            <returns></returns>
        </member>
